 12500.0 ? outLamp1=on  "[BK6 p.52:] Now, design a combination and program it as follows: Combination Connections left to 13 D13/6com right to 2 D2/5com left to 10 D11/4com D10/3com right to 6 D6/2com left to 9 D9/1com D8/6E* [BK6 p.52:] Light 1 comes on to indicate that the code has been solved; light 6 comes on when an error is made, and the machine then automatically re-sets for the next attempt. [BK6 p.53:] Light 1 will come on when the combination is successfully solved; light 6 will come on to indicate an error, and the player must start over again."
